      "content": "Thanks, that's a good start. To be more specific for my paper, I'm looking at the actual \"scientific\" evidence they cite. Could you go into more detail about the specific studies or data points that proponents usually point to when they argue for a genetic component? Like, what kind of hereditary or population genetics research do they typically use to support the idea that IQ differences are more than just environmental? I want to make sure I capture the \"scientific\" side of their argument accurately.",
